
# Multi-Fraud Detection System

## About the Project
This project detects potentially fraudulent financial transactions using Machine Learning techniques.

## Technologies Used
- Python
- Pandas
- Scikit-learn
- Streamlit
- Machine Learning

## Features
- Upload transaction data
- Detect unusual transactions
- Calculate fraud scores
- Flag transactions for review
- Display transaction results

## Project Structure
```text
multi-fraud-detection-system/
├── app.py
├── fraud_engine.py
├── requirements.txt
├── README.md
├── .gitignore
└── data/
    └── sample_transactions.csv
```

## Installation

Install the required libraries:

```bash
pip install -r requirements.txt
```

## Run the Project

```bash
streamlit run app.py
```

## Dataset
The `data/sample_transactions.csv` file contains sample transaction data for demonstration.

## Disclaimer
This is an educational project. Its predictions are not proof of fraud and should be reviewed before taking action.
